   newest post as a polaroid stack on the right, and a way to book at first
   paint. The mosaic and polaroids fill from the feed the page already
   loads (no extra requests) into boxes that exist in the HTML — absolutely
   positioned / fixed size — so nothing on screen moves. Empty feed: the
   gradient stands, the polaroid box stays empty. #}
