   Part one holds the first K posts (3 desktop, 2 phone) and is reserved a
   screenful before the feed answers, so the form card after it starts under
   the fold and nothing on screen moves as posts land. With no posts the same
   space holds the welcome node. Part two takes the rest, Load More, and — on
   a long enough stream — the form again near the bottom. #}
<div class="live-stream-wrap">
